## Pricing policy (default until client overrides)
- **Do not publish a public price list** for slabs/tiles/sanitary (rates move; wholesale is negotiated).
- Default CTA copy: **“Contractor / trade pricing on enquiry”** or **“Ask for trade rate”**.
- Optional later (only if client supplies): “Starting from” bands, or “Laying with Materials — estimate after measure”.
- Catalogue upload = visuals + names + finishes; prices stay enquiry-gated unless client explicitly provides numbers.

## Image / catalogue policy
- **Drop zone (chat uploads fail):** `website/catalogues/` — see `DROP_HERE.md`.
- Athangudi PDFs/images → `website/catalogues/athangudi/` (theme + tile SKUs).
- Other PDFs → `website/catalogues/other-catalogues/`.
- Real stock photos → `website/catalogues/product-photos/<hall>/`.
- Free Unsplash/Pexels only as **mood**, labelled **Mood · not stock SKU**, until Athangudi/product files replace them.
- Never present random web photos as Elite Balaji inventory.
- Do not scrape competitor catalogues as “our products”.
- Stack default is **free**; ask before any paid domain, hosting upgrade, or photo shoot.

## UX rules
- Brand name is hero-level on the entrance — not only in a nav.
- First viewport: brand + COMPLETE FLOORING SOLUTION + one CTA + Athangudi-patterned showroom plane (once catalogue is in).
- One job per hall: browse materials → enquire.
- Mobile + desktop; enquire (call / WhatsApp) always reachable.
- No contractor pitch spam on the public site — that belongs to Marketing Agent later.

